TravelShipB Moknatha Enter
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
        Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
        -------- ========================= --------
        Sound - Play TravelShipWhat3 <gen>
        -------- ========================= --------
        -------- SET CAMERA --------
        Set VariableSet CameraPlayer = Player 1 (Red)
        Set VariableSet Variable = Value
        Custom script:   call FCL_Lock(udg_CameraUnit, udg_CameraPlayer)
        Cinematic - Enable user control for (All players).
        -------- ========================= --------
        Unit - Hide Nazgrek
        Unit - Change ownership of Nazgrek to Neutral Passive and Retain color
        Unit Group - Add Nazgrek to TravelShip_Group
        -------- ========================= --------
        -------- Check if Zul'kis is close --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (TravelShipMoknatha <gen> contains Zulkis) Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Unit - Hide Zulkis
                Unit Group - Add Zulkis to TravelShip_Group
            Else - Actions
        -------- Check if companions are close --------
        Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in Companion_Group and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (TravelShipMoknatha <gen> contains (Picked unit)) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Hide (Picked unit)
                        Unit Group - Add (Picked unit) to TravelShip_Group
                    Else - Actions
        Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in Pet and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (TravelShipMoknatha <gen> contains (Picked unit)) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Hide (Picked unit)
                        Unit Group - Add (Picked unit) to TravelShip_Group
                    Else - Actions
        -------- ========================= --------
        Set VariableSet TravelShipB_Traveling = True
        -------- ========================= --------
        -------- Attach units to the ship --------
        Unit - Create 1 Nazgrek for Neutral Passive at RUA_Point facing (Random angle) degrees
        Set VariableSet RUA_DummyUnit = (Last created unit)
        Set VariableSet RUA_TargetUnit = TravelShipB
        Custom script:   call RUA_CreateUnitAttachment(udg_RUA_TargetUnit, udg_RUA_DummyUnit, 400, 205, 500, false, false)
